{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: a timed quest takes a client slot and the overflow survives a relog",
  "contract": [
    "The client shows quest timers only for its own slots, so a timed quest never stays in the overflow log. A Hunter's Boast (257, 15 minutes) accepted on a full client log swaps with the idlest native quest, Jitters' Growling Gut (5) from slot 0, which moves to the overflow log.",
    "After a relog every quest is still in the log and the timed quest still has a client slot. Jitters' Growling Gut and Powder to Ironband (302) have no objectives, so both hold QUEST_STATUS_COMPLETE (1) for as long as they stay in the log."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "quest_log_size": 64,
